  "steps": [
    "Add butter to a pan, then add 4-5 cloves of finely chopped garlic.",
    "Add in 1 thinly chopped onion. Let it sauté and then add in a cup of spinach.",
    "After 2-3 mins add in brocolli and mushrooms.",
    "Cover and let this cook for 6-7 mins until the brocolli is cooked.",
    "Add in bell peppers and cook for 5 mins and then add 120g tofu/ 120 low fat paneer/ meat.",
    "Add salt, 1/2 tsp red chilli powder, 1 tsp oregano, 1 tsp mixed herbs, sprinkle of pepper.",
    "Let it cook for 5 mins. Top with toasted and crushed walnuts and serve it with rice/noodles."
